{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 5180,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Librarian Source Enrichment L1 Workflow (Proposed To-Be)\n**Symptom:** Part-count masked failed _document_pass/relate_chapters, before-item-only budget checks leaked inner calls, and 0-claim Geo paper DBs silently passed.\n**Root cause:** Record activation trigger, enforce NAT-13 keys + MC-10 reserve, whole-source derivation checks, poison quarantine, Geo non-zero verification, and zero mid-loop Owner blocks.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `librarian-source-enrichment-tobe.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-bind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** binds Source, narrowed L1 sub-run mandate (sub_spec_owner=lead_tier1 <= parent), NAT-13 & MF-013/014"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dwork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ L1 workflow admission source?",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-controls",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**2.** checks cancel/lease flags and runs MC-10 atomic pre-dispatch budget reserve"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-userread",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "admits Context 3 UI reread/deep_read_note under person/workflow_grant route"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-t0read",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "verifies Context 1/2 Delegated Commission Envelope for Source L1 workflow"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-enowork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4840,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ no new work admitted; compatible NAT-13 receipts reused\n*outcome: reused*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dcontrols",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ controls permit dispatch?",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-validate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**3.** verifies evidence hash, NAT-13 route/recipe key, and fresh publish state"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-retpause_at_f4db34be67",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns MC-10 ceiling, cancel, or ORACLE_ROUTE_COLLISION (unverified) pause Ticket"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-retesc_at_d6c25aad81",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "escalates critical integrity or authority-boundary fault to invoking parent"
    },
